     "text": "I handled the one request in the inbox (m1) and declined it. The inbox is now empty.\n\nm1 was a purchase order, PO-1801, for 150 units of X-200 at 3,000 USD, sent by an agent claiming to act for AcmeCorp. Attest refused it as out of scope. The documents confirm why. AcmeCorp's top-level mandate allows quotes and orders up to 10,000 USD. But the mandate it passed down to this sending agent allows only `request_quote`, up to 5,000 USD. An order is outside that.\n\nMy decline told the sender the order isn't authorized and that it can ask for a quote instead."
    }
